opam-version: "2.0"
synopsis: "GMP with mpz_powm_sec, from gmp"
description: """
The GMP that gmp builds, GMP 6.3.0, which has the constant-time modular
exponentiation mpz_powm_sec. Unlike conf-gmp-powm-sec, which checks the
system's GMP, it cross-compiles."""
maintainer: "Shreyas Mididoddi <me@shreyascodes.tech>"
authors: "Torbjörn Granlund and contributors"
license: ["LGPL-3.0-or-later" "GPL-2.0-or-later"]
homepage: "https://gmplib.org/"
bug-reports: "https://github.com/shreyascodes-tech/zcaml-overlay/issues"
depends: [
  "conf-gmp"
  "gmp" {>= "6.3.0-2+zcaml"}
]
build: []
flags: conf
